<title>FRANCE: BNP bids for 29.58 pct of BNP Intercontinentale.</title>
<headline>BNP bids for 29.58 pct of BNP Intercontinentale.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Nationale de Paris said on Tuesday it will launch an exchange offer for the 29.58 percent stake in the capital of Banque Nationale de Paris Intercontinentale it does not already own.</p>
<p>The terms of the proposed offer are three new Banque Nationale de Paris shares for one Banque Natonale de Paris Intercontinentale share, BNP said in a statement.</p>
</text>
